      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.57,
      "end_seconds": 3.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. Lovely to meet you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.67,
      "end_seconds": 13.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.83,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 14.66,
      "end_seconds": 23.95,
      "duration_seconds": 9.29,
      "text": "Good afternoon, doctor. I look after them so I thought I'd come. She's been having been wanting contraception, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.86,
      "end_seconds": 27.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.85,
      "end_seconds": 37.4,
      "duration_seconds": 7.55,
      "text": "Around about three months... no wait, um, it's more like about a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.55,
      "end_seconds": 41.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Is it bearing on you a lot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.4,
      "end_seconds": 56.96,
      "duration_seconds": 12.56,
      "text": "I'd call it mild as for slightly heavy periods, I honestly can't say when that began it might have been last month or the month before"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.8,
      "end_seconds": 64.1,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "Right, have you had any migraine with aura, breast lumps or smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.27,
      "end_seconds": 67.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "No, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.98,
      "end_seconds": 72.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.66,
      "end_seconds": 74.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "No problems with breathing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.7,
      "end_seconds": 80.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "so, what about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.31,
      "end_seconds": 85.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Bowels are regular, nothing odd."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.74,
      "end_seconds": 94.51,
      "duration_seconds": 6.77,
      "text": "do you have any long-term conditions? These questions might sound routine, but they matter"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.97,
      "end_seconds": 98.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "I've got an irregular heartbeat."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.41,
      "end_seconds": 103.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "What do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.5,
      "end_seconds": 110.93,
      "duration_seconds": 6.43,
      "text": "I take metoprolol, 50 milligrams, maybe, twice a day for the heart rhythm"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.48,
      "end_seconds": 116.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "Have you got the box or the prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.71,
      "end_seconds": 122.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "No, it's at home."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.47,
      "end_seconds": 137.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "Any surgery in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.58,
      "end_seconds": 144.14,
      "duration_seconds": 5.56,
      "text": "Just a caesarean for my second baby, nine years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.49,
      "end_seconds": 164.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.16,
      "end_seconds": 170.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.69,
      "end_seconds": 174.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Okay, have you retired yet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.24,
      "end_seconds": 179.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "I retired from the post office two years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.77,
      "end_seconds": 182.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.71,
      "end_seconds": 188.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.65,
      "end_seconds": 208.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.22,
      "end_seconds": 219.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.84,
      "end_seconds": 245.83,
      "duration_seconds": 7.99,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 123 over 80, temp 36.4 degrees, SpO2 99 percent on room air. And heart rate 74."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.29,
      "end_seconds": 249.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "May I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.72,
      "end_seconds": 253.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "alright, take a deep breath for me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.25,
      "end_seconds": 272.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Your blood pressure is normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.03,
      "end_seconds": 308.29,
      "duration_seconds": 33.26,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check. So, based on the history and the examination, my working impression is suitable for hormonal contraception with no risk factors. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together. The treatment will be levonorgestrel and ethinylestradiol, 150 micrograms and 30 micrograms, once a day, long term. That should help with contraception. Take the pill at the same time each day and use condoms if you miss two."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.8,
      "end_seconds": 328.03,
      "duration_seconds": 18.23,
      "text": "And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. Come back or go to emergency straight away if you get leg swelling or severe headaches. I'd like you back in three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 329.19,
      "end_seconds": 329.89,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.43,
      "end_seconds": 335.89,
      "duration_seconds": 5.46,
      "text": "Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 337.76,
      "end_seconds": 342.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "Right, uh, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor."
    }
  ]
}